 "positioning_statement": "FOR time-pressed professionals who want adventure that restores them rather than wears them out, WHO need real challenge and real recovery in the same trip without planning it themselves, ROAMWILD IS the small-group adventure travel company THAT matches every trip to your fitness and balances each day of effort with genuine recovery, BECAUSE every itinerary is built from a Fit Profile, paced by guides certified in recovery, and capped at ten travelers.",
 "positioning": {
  "Target audience": "Restorative Adventurers: time-pressed professionals, median income about $162K, around 40 years old, who want adventure that leaves them restored (16% of customers, 42% of lifetime gross profit).",
